<http://data.silknow.org/object/af82415d-7e7f-3cbc-8f95-74fc8370b5ef>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Light blue silk ground in compound weave.  Brocaded in polychrome silks, silver wire wound on a silk core and frise silver yarn.  Buildings and ruins surrounded by trees and flowers.  Scene of the interior of a room with furniture and a Chinese figure smoking a long pipe.  Composed of several pieces, some with black selvedge of twelve cords.  Strip of cotton tabby cloth on back.  Worn."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/5b68b041-dcf4-39c0-af64-c7843f3be8ac> ;
